            Find interest-based spaces where students collaborate on meaningful projects.
          </p>
          <div className="mt-8 relative max-w-xl mx-auto">
            <input 
              type="text" 
              placeholder="Search by interests, tags, or keywords..." 
              className="w-full pl-12 pr-4 py-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl shadow-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent outline-none transition-all dark:text-white"
              value={search}
              onChange={(e) => setSearch(e.target.value)}
